<div class="page">
  <header class="visit-hero">
    <div class="visit-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="{{ 'kutch-rann.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
      <span class="visit-hero__scrim"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="container visit-hero__inner">
      <p class="visit-hero__eyebrow">Visit &amp; Experience</p>
      <h1 class="visit-hero__title">Kutch</h1>
      <p class="visit-hero__lede">Stand where it is made — the studio, the museum and the villages.</p>
      <a class="visit-hero__cta" href="#places">Explore</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section container ways" aria-label="Two ways to visit">
    <article class="way">
      <div class="way__media">
        <img src="{{ 'visit-campus.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The Shrujan studio floor, with racks of finished cloth and staff at work" loading="lazy">
        <span class="way__no" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
      </div>

      <div class="way__body">
        <p class="way__kicker">By appointment</p>
        <h2 class="way__name">The Shrujan Campus</h2>
        <p class="way__copy">A behind-the-scenes visit, arranged in advance. You follow a piece from an idea through sampling and into production, and see how the design studio and the artisan communities actually work together. It is a visit about process, not a shop.</p>

        <ul class="way__points">
          <li>Design studio &amp; sampling</li>
          <li>Pre and post production</li>
          <li>The coordination team</li>
        </ul>

        <a class="arrow-link way__cta" href="mailto:marketing@shrujan.com?subject=Campus%20visit">Enquire about a visit <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="way">
      <div class="way__media">
        <img src="{{ 'visit-lakhpat.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The walled fort at Lakhpat above the salt flat" loading="lazy">
        <span class="way__no" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
      </div>

      <div class="way__body">
        <p class="way__kicker">Any time in season</p>
        <h2 class="way__name">Kutch itself</h2>
        <p class="way__copy">The district the work comes from: craft villages within an hour of Bhuj, a museum built for the embroidery, and a landscape that turns to salt flat and back again. Come for a day, or plan a week around it.</p>

        <ul class="way__points">
          <li>Craft villages &amp; workshops</li>
          <li>The LLDC museum</li>
          <li>Palaces, port towns, the Rann</li>
        </ul>

        <a class="arrow-link way__cta" href="tel:+919099974319">Plan your trip <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section container stops" id="places">
    <div class="stops__head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Where to go</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Six stops, <em>all near Bhuj</em></h2>
      <p class="stops__lede">The workrooms, the museum, and the villages the stitches are named after — none of them more than a couple of hours apart.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stops__grid" data-reveal-child>
      <article class="stop">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'visit-design-studio.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Designers at work on patterns in the Shrujan studio" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Bhuj · by appointment</span>
        <span class="stop__name">The Shrujan Campus</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">The design studio, sampling rooms and production floor, 10am to 7pm.</span>
      </article>

      <a class="stop stop--link" href="/pages/lldc">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'visit-lldc.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A round white gallery building on the design centre campus" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Ajrakhpur · 20 min from Bhuj</span>
        <span class="stop__name">LLDC Museum</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">The Living &amp; Learning Design Centre — galleries, archive and teaching studios.</span>

        <span class="stop__go">Read more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg></span>
      </a>

      <article class="stop">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'bottom-left.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Master weaver working threads at his handloom" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Bhujodi · 8 km east</span>
        <span class="stop__name">Bhujodi Weavers</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">Pit looms in working homes, weaving wool and cotton for the desert winter.</span>
      </article>

      <article class="stop">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'visit-ajrakhpur.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A printer working a block along a long table of cloth" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Ajrakhpur</span>
        <span class="stop__name">Ajrakhpur Block Printers</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">Resist printing in madder and indigo, sixteen stages deep, done in the open air.</span>
      </article>

      <article class="stop">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'visit-banni.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Artisan women embroidering together at the centre" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Northern Kutch</span>
        <span class="stop__name">The Banni Villages</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">Suf, Mutava and Jat embroidery, in the grasslands the stitches are named after.</span>
      </article>

      <article class="stop">
        <span class="stop__media">
          <img src="{{ 'visit-vijay-vilas.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Vijay Vilas Palace at Mandvi" loading="lazy">
          <span class="stop__no" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
        </span>

        <span class="stop__where">Mandvi and the western edge</span>
        <span class="stop__name">Vijay Vilas &amp; Lakhpat</span>
        <span class="stop__copy">A seaside palace and a walled port town the sea left behind.</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container plan" id="plan">
    <div class="plan__head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">How long to stay</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Plan the <em>trip</em></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="plan__grid">
      <div class="plan__main">
        <ol class="plan__steps" data-reveal-child>
          <li class="stay">
            <span class="stay__no" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <span class="stay__len">Half a day</span>
            <span class="stay__what">The campus in the morning, LLDC in the afternoon.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stay">
            <span class="stay__no" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
            <span class="stay__len">One day</span>
            <span class="stay__what">Add the Bhujodi looms and an hour in the Bhuj bazaar.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stay">
            <span class="stay__no" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
            <span class="stay__len">Two days</span>
            <span class="stay__what">Ajrakhpur printing and a Banni village, with an interpreter.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="stay">
            <span class="stay__no" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
            <span class="stay__len">A week</span>
            <span class="stay__what">All of it, plus Mandvi, Lakhpat and the Rann at full moon.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="plan__invite" data-reveal>
          <p class="plan__invite-copy">Tell us when you are coming and we will open the studio.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost plan__invite-cta" href="mailto:marketing@shrujan.com?subject=Visiting%20Shrujan">Write to the studio <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="plan__aside" data-reveal>
        <p class="plan__season"><span class="plan__pill">Best season</span>November to February. The desert is unforgiving either side of it.</p>

        <dl class="plan__facts">
          <div>
            <dt>Open</dt>
            <dd>10 AM to 7 PM</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Campus visits</dt>
            <dd>By appointment — email or call ahead</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Email</dt>
            <dd>marketing@shrujan.com</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Call</dt>
            <dd>+91 9099 974319 · +91 90818 99882</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>Nearest airport</dt>
            <dd>Bhuj (BHJ)</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <a class="btn plan__cta" href="tel:+919099974319">Call to plan <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 12h15"></path><path d="m13.5 6.5 5.5 5.5-5.5 5.5"></path></svg></a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
